      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL ON BLACK (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, a nose from the winner Newtown Brett (18.98) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from three starts. Likely to feature again. GASP GORGEOUS (3) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a half a length win at this track in a handy 19.35. Draws to advantage and likes the trip. Can measure up again. BANKSY'S BEST (6) was a course and distance winner (19.16) last time also from the same draw, scoring by 3 lengths in a Grade 6. Harder here but expected to measure up. DETECTIVE (1) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
